{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CT/MRI 检查级基础模型：输入单位从切片走向完整 study</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Volumetric Study FMs</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_042_merlin-title\">Merlin</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 I3D ResNet-152 原生编码完整 CT，并用 EHR phenotype prediction 与 Clinical Longformer 报告对比进行多源多任务预训练。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Native 3D abdominal CT foundation model encoding whole volumes with an I3D ResNet-152 supervised jointly by EHR diagnosis codes (phenotypes) and radiology reports.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">三维 CT 体积、同检查放射报告与 EHR diagnosis codes</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Volumetric 3D abdominal CT scan + paired free-text radiology report + longitudinal EHR ICD diagnosis codes</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">检查级 3D 视觉语言表征及零样本/适配后临床任务输出</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Study-level 3D visual-linguistic representation supporting zero-shot findings, EHR phenotype prediction, and 3D segmentation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.Official HTML Figure 1 asset</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10181-8\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_042_merlin')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_042_merlin')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Merlin original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/c56c2a02376ec883fa1f.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.Official HTML Figure 1 asset</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_042_merlin\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_042_merlin')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_042_merlin\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D CT Volume</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D CT Volume</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">完整体积经统一视野与体素预处理输入，而不是随机单切片。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests volumetric 3d abdominal ct scan + paired free-text radiology report + longitudinal ehr icd diagnosis codes and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT Volume).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"完整体积经统一视野与体素预处理输入，而不是随机单切片。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests volumetric 3d abdominal ct scan + paired free-text radiology report + longitudinal ehr icd diagnosis codes and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT Volume).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D CT Volume\" data-node-name-en=\"3D CT Volume\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D CT Volume</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">完整体积经统一视野与体素预处理输入，而不是随机单切片。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests volumetric 3d abdominal ct scan + paired free-text radiology report + longitudinal ehr icd diagnosis codes and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT Volume).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将 2D ResNet 卷积核沿深度维膨胀，原生编码层间解剖与全体积上下文。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes I3D ResNet-152 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"I3D ResNet-152\" data-node-name-en=\"I3D ResNet-152\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>I3D ResNet-152</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将 2D ResNet 卷积核沿深度维膨胀，原生编码层间解剖与全体积上下文。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes I3D ResNet-152 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3D feature map 经聚合/投影得到检查级向量，同时保留可供下游 decoder 使用的空间特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CT Embedding within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"CT Embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"CT Embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CT Embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3D feature map 经聚合/投影得到检查级向量，同时保留可供下游 decoder 使用的空间特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CT Embedding within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"检查相关的结构化表型/诊断代码提供多标签临床监督。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs EHR Diagnosis Codes within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"EHR Diagnosis Codes\" data-node-name-en=\"EHR Diagnosis Codes\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>EHR Diagnosis Codes</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">检查相关的结构化表型/诊断代码提供多标签临床监督。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs EHR Diagnosis Codes within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 CT embedding 预测多种 diagnosis-code phenotypes，注入结构化疾病语义。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs prediction Head within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"表型预测 Head\" data-node-name-en=\"prediction Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">表型预测 Head</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prediction Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 CT embedding 预测多种 diagnosis-code phenotypes，注入结构化疾病语义。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs prediction Head within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"长篇 findings/impression 等检查文本作为非结构化监督。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Radiology Report within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"放射报告\" data-node-name-en=\"Radiology Report\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">放射报告</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Radiology Report</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">长篇 findings/impression 等检查文本作为非结构化监督。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Radiology Report within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"长上下文临床语言 encoder 处理最长 4,096 tokens 的报告内容。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Clinical Longformer within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Clinical Longformer\" data-node-name-en=\"Clinical Longformer\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Clinical Longformer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">长上下文临床语言 encoder 处理最长 4,096 tokens 的报告内容。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Clinical Longformer within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"检查级 CT 与配对报告在共享空间对齐，并与非配对报告分离。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CT– within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"CT–报告对比\" data-node-name-en=\"CT–\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">CT–报告对比</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CT–</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">检查级 CT 与配对报告在共享空间对齐，并与非配对报告分离。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CT– within the core native 3d ct multitask vision language computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"结构化 EHR 预测与报告对比可联合/分阶段优化同一 3D encoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies multi-task pretraining to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"多任务预训练\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-task pretraining\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多任务预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-task pretraining</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">结构化 EHR 预测与报告对比可联合/分阶段优化同一 3D encoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies multi-task pretraining to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"冻结/适配后用于零样本 findings、检索、疾病预测、报告生成和 3D 分割。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces study-level 3d visual-linguistic representation supporting zero-shot findings, ehr phenotype prediction, and 3d segmentation via Stage 10.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"临床任务接口\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 10\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_042_merlin', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">临床任务接口</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 10</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">冻结/适配后用于零样本 findings、检索、疾病预测、报告生成和 3D 分割。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces study-level 3d visual-linguistic representation supporting zero-shot findings, ehr phenotype prediction, and 3d segmentation via Stage 10.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Merlin Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · Merlin 用 EHR 表型与长报告联合监督 3D CT</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Joint Multi-Task Supervision: 3D CT–Report Contrastive Loss + EHR Phenotype Binary Cross-Entropy</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Merlin：核心公式 · Merlin 用 EHR 表型与长报告联合监督 3D CT\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"42\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.223741pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.00913 264.164409 11.223741\" width=\"264.164409pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M7.364661-.665003L7.315034-.764257C6.888241-.297763 6.26294 0 5.627713 0C4.545842 0 3.503673-.327539 2.47143-.595525C3.5533-1.558291 4.168676-2.650087 4.406886-4.079348C4.525991-4.823754 4.635171-6.511075 5.67734-6.511