\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"62.76179\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g13-50\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"67.479102\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g7-186\" y=\"-60.874245\"></use><use x=\"73.508574\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g7-184\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"81.929166\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g13-95\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"87.508239\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-86\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"92.759152\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-76\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"99.56057\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g7-76\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"107.221831\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-67\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"112.072741\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-76\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"116.516379\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-73\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"118.9382\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-80\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"124.27695\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g4-0\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"129.128747\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g13-53\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"131.997989\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-51\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"135.852534\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g10-25\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"143.165144\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g7-185\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"146.881204\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g13-71\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"151.787787\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g7-186\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"155.603462\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g13-150\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"161.597594\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g13-53\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"164.466835\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-76\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"168.910474\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-111\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"172.546839\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-110\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"176.183204\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g17-103\" y=\"-59.364921\"></use><use x=\"180.815807\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g7-185\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"184.372467\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g13-65\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"188.995122\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g7-186\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"193.010055\" xlink:href=\"#m042_g4-1\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">逐切片 2D VLM 无法充分建模体积解剖和检查级上下文</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Slice-wise 2D VLMs fail to capture 3D volumetric continuity, while report-only supervision misses structured longitudinal EHR outcomes.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">联合 3D CT、EHR diagnosis codes 与报告学习检查级视觉语言表示</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Train a native 3D convolutional encoder on 15,331 paired abdominal CTs using both free-text reports (Clinical-Longformer) and 1,692 EHR phenotypes.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">原生 3D encoder、多源临床监督与 44098 个外部 CT 的验证</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Synergistic dual supervision (radiology prose + structured EHR codes) on native 3D volumes, validated across 44,098 external CTs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">代表腹部 CT 主训练域上的原生 3D VLM 与外部大规模评估</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Supports zero-shot abnormality classification, cross-modal retrieval, 5-year chronic disease risk prediction, and 3D organ segmentation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">已发表证据较强的 3D CT FM 之一；仍为回顾性且非自治报告安全证明</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Among the most thoroughly externally validated 3D CT foundation models; evidence remains retrospective.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">I3D 把二维预训练卷积核沿 z 轴膨胀，在继承初始化的同时让模型直接学习体积解剖。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">EHR codes 提供结构化多标签疾病监督，长报告提供自由文本语义，两者从不同角度约束同一 CT encoder。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">CT–报告共享嵌入支持零样本与检索，保留的 3D feature hierarchy 又可接生成或分割 decoder。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Train a native 3D convolutional encoder on 15,331 paired abdominal CTs using both free-text reports (Clinical-Longformer) and 1,692 EHR phenotypes.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Synergistic dual supervision (radiology prose + structured EHR codes) on native 3D volumes, validated across 44,098 external CTs.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Joint Multi-Task Supervision: 3D CT–Report Contrastive Loss + EHR Phenotype Binary Cross-Entropy.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">Merlin 代表从逐切片 2D VLM 转向原生 3D 检查级建模，并已覆盖外部 CT 验证与多类适配任务。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">训练主域仍以腹部 CT 和回顾性 EHR 为核心；代码标签偏差、报告生成事实性与前瞻工作流安全需分别验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Supports zero-shot abnormality classification, cross-modal retrieval, 5-year chronic disease risk prediction, and 3D organ segmentation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Among the most thoroughly externally validated 3D CT foundation models; evidence remains retrospective.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-10181-8\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Merlin: a Computed Tomography Vision-Language Foundation Model and Dataset</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/StanfordMIMI/Merlin\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
